OL,3,AHouthis claim attack on Saudi capital
OL,4,Aafter smoke seen rising near Riyadh
OL,5,Aairport
OL,6,
OL,7,FIran-backed Houthi militants in Yemen
OL,8,Fsay they carried out drone and missile
OL,9,Fattacks on the Saudi capital Riyadh and
OL,10,Fenergy sites on the country's Red Sea
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,13,FA column of black smoke was seen rising
OL,14,Ffrom what appeared to be fuel tanks
OL,15,Fnear the Saudi capital's international
OL,16,Fairport where flights were disrupted
OL,17,Ftemporarily.
OL,19,FCity residents had been given an alert
OL,20,Fand urged to stay indoors, the first
OL,21,Fsuch alert since a recent escalation in
OL,22,Fthe conflict with the Houthis.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
